@language_proficiency_blockchain_HostAddress = http://localhost:5141

GET {{language_proficiency_blockchain_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

# Blockchain API examples

## Get local node public key
GET {{language_proficiency_blockchain_HostAddress}}/api/blockchain/node-info
Accept: application/json

###

## List nodes
GET {{language_proficiency_blockchain_HostAddress}}/api/blockchain/nodes
Accept: application/json

###

## Get full chain
GET {{language_proficiency_blockchain_HostAddress}}/api/blockchain/chain
Accept: application/json

###

## Propose a new node
# Replace the placeholder values below. "signatureBase64" should be a signature of the concatenated string
# "publicKeyPem|address" created with the node's private key.
POST {{language_proficiency_blockchain_HostAddress}}/api/blockchain/nodes
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "publicKeyPem": "-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----\nREPLACE_WITH_BASE64_KEY\n-----END PUBLIC KEY-----\n",
  "address": "my-node-address.example.com",
  "signatureBase64": "REPLACE_WITH_BASE64_SIGNATURE"
}

###

## Approve a node
# Path parameter {id} is the proposed node's ID to approve.
# Body field "approverNodeId" is the GUID of the local approved node issuing the approval.
# "signatureBase64" should be a signature of the string "{id}|{approverNodeId}" by the approver's private key.
POST {{language_proficiency_blockchain_HostAddress}}/api/blockchain/nodes/{{id}}
    ?approve
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "approverNodeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "signatureBase64": "REPLACE_WITH_BASE64_SIGNATURE"
}

###

## Submit a test result to the blockchain
# "signatureBase64" should be a signature of the string
# "testId|studentId|institutionId|score|submittedByNodeId|timestamp" by the submitter node's private key.
POST {{language_proficiency_blockchain_HostAddress}}/api/blockchain/results
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "testId": "TOEFL-2025-ABC123",
  "studentId": "student-42",
  "institutionId": "uni-1000",
  "score": "115",
  "submittedByNodeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "timestamp": "2025-01-01T12:00:00Z",
  "signatureBase64": "REPLACE_WITH_BASE64_SIGNATURE"
}

###

## Get a submitted test result by id
GET {{language_proficiency_blockchain_HostAddress}}/api/blockchain/results/{{resultId}}
Accept: application/json

###
